[{"client_msg_id":"171582bc-b1ef-4467-acd2-59785f30f2fe","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"まあ抜いた二日後にちょっとでかけたら後は抜糸までゆっくりできるはずなので……","ts":"1629209504.024700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gau6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b6ac91ce-d25d-4e97-8abc-9234c8d90435","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"抜歯後はちゃんと保全しましょう(真顔\n自分はちゃんとしてたけど止血しきれなくて急遽行ったりしたことがあったので、油断はだめ","ts":"1629208006.023500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O4R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d1349fa-10cc-4b4d-81d0-abb4d27b3ffa","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"抜いた後に熱々のラーメン食べるのはやめた方がいいですよ(経験者","ts":"1629207822.022800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1=n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d77d7a58-b961-4a6d-a7d3-a8d97b57d774","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"麻酔してても親知らずに衝撃や力加えてるなってわかりますよ","ts":"1629207726.022200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sdTY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78328f4b-0670-447b-aea2-bca2f4d8f356","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"オッ 健康な親知らずの抜歯ですか","ts":"1629207691.021600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FBN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"573700dc-f0c0-4e92-8d5f-ec9bee33ec64","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"僕も大学病院ですね\n抜糸まで家でゆっくりできるかと思ったらいくつか用事ができたのであまりゆっくりもしてられないという……","ts":"1629207224.020900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9i2s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aae23e61-be04-4b5e-8816-b47f0dd4443d","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"横向きに生えているとそうみたいです。\n通院している歯医者で大学病院の紹介状を書いてもらいました。","ts":"1629206756.018000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eSip"}]},{"client_msg_id":"CA0280FA-5801-44E8-B39C-B4F3520EBB79","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"親知らずの下側ってそんなに大掛かりなんですね、、","ts":"1629206666.017400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t4O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba970522-2ae5-4d81-980b-ef6040a803c8","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"親知らずは四本とも抜きました。","ts":"1629206214.016200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w/v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d01345a-4479-47eb-8b76-9a3d4701675e","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"麻酔をするので、そんなに大変ではないと思いますよ。\nノミとハンマーを使ったり、掘削機っぽいのを使ったり、抜いたあとに縫ってもらったりしますけど。（こう書くと不安になりそうだな）","ts":"1629206201.016000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X=="}]},{"client_msg_id":"8dd194e2-cc29-480f-870a-d9aff42b91be","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そのほうがいいよね、虫歯になってからだともっと大変だと思う。","ts":"1629205997.014800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aia"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c5f3204f-fe66-4e99-af22-438bc44c77fc","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"虫歯になりかけてるとかって訳じゃない（予防的に変な生え方してる一本だけ抜いておく）感じですね","ts":"1629205978.014300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SCM5M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08d773ee-e352-421e-b5b2-04eb28857c6d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー...まあもう割るの確定ならあとは恐怖との戦いかな。処置中は麻酔するし...","ts":"1629205961.013900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9XK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"906dfda3-7d06-4ea3-aecf-0a95e6f3d468","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ガッツリ横に生えてるから抜くって話になったのでまあ……","ts":"1629205927.012900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ES1uV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed70f2ea-c447-441f-b3e0-a633552a9608","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"状態によるからなあ、自分は親不知は抜いてないけど、その前にある奥歯は合計3本抜いてる\nうち2本は割れたので腫れが問題だったが、最後の1つは別理由だったのでグリグリ抜き、まあどうにかなるなる\n横に生えてなければ","ts":"1629205900.012500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jtn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0f24869-b718-44c5-b8d9-79e41d7a7a56","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"これだけで下って分かるんですか……\n歯の本格的な治療というか処置ってこれが初めてなのでどんな感じかいまいち分からないんですよね","ts":"1629205830.011100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZnwiA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c68d1cb5-fdc9-4975-b1c2-a0076ac956c8","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"その反応は下の歯ですね。\nちょっとした工事なので、むしろ笑いがこみあげてくるかも。","ts":"1629205609.010100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zg3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d9c428e2-a725-4aa6-ad08-604426e829c7","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"明日親知らずを抜くのでちょっと怯えてる","ts":"1629205407.009000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v0lI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20696928-a036-4668-8347-6eec9c73e837","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そしてパラリンピック向けのバッジが初まった\n直前1weekのやつはいいとして、デイピンもくるらしいので、また集めそうだw","ts":"1629199659.008400","thread_ts":"1629069017.455400","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Uuun"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"4373cebd-3ed9-4e63-9ad3-20cca34dcb61","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"たぶん mattn さんはわかってくれる?\nCoke-onのオリンピックの、コツコツ集めて交換して(友人との交換以外は)コンプリート\n\u003chttps://flic.kr/p/2mhcgoA\u003e\n\u003chttps://flic.kr/p/2mhgaFj\u003e\n\u003chttps://flic.kr/p/2mhcgux\u003e\n\u003chttps://flic.kr/p/2mhcgrm\u003e\n\u003chttps://flic.kr/p/2mg2vCB\u003e","ts":"1629069017.455400","thread_ts":"1629069017.455400","