message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"この実験、NHK  の驚異の小宇宙人体でやってたけど、脚の筋繊維が異常に細くなるのと、破骨細胞が優位になって骨がもろくなるって話じゃなかったっけ。なので人を宇宙に送り出す際は、船内での筋トレが義務付けられるようになったって番組で言ってたけど。","ts":"1629164095.493000","edited":{"user":"U76V658V6","ts":"1629164196.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H9Da"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb8ed525-c33f-418a-8bf7-a2ff3071f4ea","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"大変なやつだ...","ts":"1629162812.491600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6bms"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a608700-5088-43cf-b18e-b9a7be7c4113","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"寝るだけのやつ、足があがってる…ガチのヤツだ。","ts":"1629162735.491300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bxO/1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e755885-702f-4581-99f2-bb9cac7f3536","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"中国のアイドルだった希ガス","ts":"1629128522.490700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Trpi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a8219303-4852-4564-b947-1e2deeec482d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"寝ている様子を配信したアイドルいなかったっけ","ts":"1629128258.490400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I/6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4962eabb-8bea-49a1-a144-913b6c715530","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"某ウェッブ小説投稿サイトで寝るだけでレベルアップする小説があったな","ts":"1629126085.489200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J+o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"BC9C3CF7-4E93-47FF-BEF0-92F8F37ECE4E","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほど","ts":"1629126056.488700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HZq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21B930D6-176C-473A-B444-CE41EAD8C49B","type":"